cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RESIST, please cite the following. Jialu Liang, Yining Pan, and Minghao Zhou contributed equally. Correspondence: Qianqian Song (song1081@purdue.edu)."
title: "RESIST: an integrative resource for systematic characterization of cancer drug resistance mechanisms"
abstract: >-
  RESIST is a large-scale single-cell and spatial omics resource that
  systematically characterizes the regulatory mechanisms underlying cancer
  drug resistance across 81 scRNA-seq and 7 spatial transcriptome datasets,
  522 single-cell and 96 spatial samples, 13 cancer types and 59 drug
  regimens.
url: "https://resist.website/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/QSong-github/RESIST"
type: software
